<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani cotton output totals 8.77 mln bales.</title>
<headline>Pakistani cotton output totals 8.77 mln bales.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-07-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's cotton production for the whole of the 1996/97 (July-June) crop year reached 8.782 million 375-lb bales, compared to 9.938 million bales the previous year, ginners said on Sunday.</p>
<p>Delivery and ginning figures in million bales (year-ago):</p>
<p>		    Punjab	   Sindh	    Total</p>
<p> Delivery	 6.695 (8.167)  2.087 (1.771)  8.782 (9.938)</p>
<p> Pressed	  6.695 (8.166)  2.087 (1.769)  8.782 (9.935)</p>
<p> Mill sales     6.471 (7.021)  2.052 (1.297)  8.523 (8.318)</p>
<p> Export sales   0.067 (0.949)  0.023 (0.441)  0.091 (1.390)</p>
<p> CEC		nil   (nil)    nil   (nil)    nil   (nil)</p>
<p> Unsold	   0.156 (0.197)  0.011 (0.032)  0.167 (0.229)</p>
<p>-- Ovais Subhani 9221-5685192.</p>
</text>
